      "content": "i get that, but my endocrinologist is super busy and i can't get an appointment for like 3 weeks. i really can't afford to fall behind at work cuz i'm on a big project. is there like a way i can just manage the jitters myself for now? like maybe i can just take a little less or maybe take some extra magnesium or something to calm the heart racing down so i can keep my focus? i don't want to make a huge deal out of it if it's just a side effect.",
