      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you, but honestly it's not that bad, it's just like a little buzz and some extra energy. i'm not feeling sick or anything, just a bit anxious. if i just cut my dose in half right now, that would be safer than nothing, right? like, half the dose won't really hurt but it might stop the racing heart feeling so i can actually get my work done. wouldn't that be a reasonable middle ground to stay safe until i see the doctor?",
